# Homelab Control Center — web client configuration
#
# Copy to `.env.local` for local overrides:  cp .env.example .env.local
# `.env*` files are gitignored except this example. NEVER commit secrets.
#
# Only variables prefixed `VITE_` are exposed to the browser. Anything placed
# here is PUBLIC: it is embedded verbatim into the built JavaScript bundle.
# Never put a token, password or API key in this file.

# Base PATH for control plane API requests. Default: /api/v1
#
# A path, not an origin. Leave it unset unless the control plane is mounted
# under a path prefix. The client is served same-origin with the API in both
# development — the Vite dev server proxies /api to the backend, see
# vite.config.ts — and production, where the built client is served by the
# control plane itself.
#
# Setting an absolute URL here is REFUSED at startup: an off-origin API would
# require sending cookies cross-origin, which no supported deployment needs.
# VITE_API_BASE_PATH=/api/v1
